<%# Education Section %>
<section class="mt-12 animate-fade-in" style="animation-delay: 1200ms;">
  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#f7768e] mb-6 flex items-center">
    <span class="mr-2">🎓</span>
    Education
  </h3>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6">
    <div class="group p-6 rounded-lg bg-[#1f2335] border border-[#29293f] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#7aa2f7]/30 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#7aa2f7]/5 hover:scale-[1.02]">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between mb-2">
        <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#7aa2f7]">Excelsior College</h4>
        <div class="text-[#bb9af7]">2013-2017</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-[#7dcfff] mb-1">B.S. Nuclear Engineering Technology</div>
      <div class="flex items-center text-[#9ece6a] mb-4">
        <span class="mr-2">📍</span>
        Albany, NY
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4">
        <h5 class="text-[#bb9af7] mb-2">Core Engineering Technology</h5>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[#a9b1d6]">
          <% [
            "Electric Circuits: DC/AC analysis, network theorems, resonance",
            "Digital Electronics: Logic gates, Boolean algebra, digital systems",
            "Computer Programming and algorithm development",
            "Electronics: Semiconductor devices and signal processing",
            "Materials Science: Engineering materials properties and applications",
            "Thermodynamics: Energy, entropy, power cycles, heat transfer",
            "Statics, Dynamics, and Strength of Materials"
          ].each do |bullet| %>
            <li class="flex items-baseline group/item">
              <span class="text-[#9ece6a] mr-2 group-hover/item:text-[#f7768e] transition-colors">⁜</span>
              <%= bullet %>
            </li>
          <% end %>
        </ul>

        <h5 class="text-[#bb9af7] mt-6 mb-2">Nuclear-Specific Coursework</h5>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[#a9b1d6]">
          <% [
            "Reactor Fundamentals: Core design, neutron lifecycle, reactivity",
            "Nuclear Physics: Radioactivity and particle interactions",
            "Radiation Protection: Biological effects and shielding design",
            "Reactor Chemistry: Coolant chemistry and corrosion control",
            "Nuclear Materials: Fuel fabrication and radiation effects",
            "Health Physics: Radiation measurement and dosimetry",
            "Reactor Safety: Accident analysis and safety systems"
          ].each do |bullet| %>
            <li class="flex items-baseline group/item">
              <span class="text-[#9ece6a] mr-2 group-hover/item:text-[#f7768e] transition-colors">⁜</span>
              <%= bullet %>
            </li>
          <% end %>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-[#24283b] rounded-lg text-[#a9b1d6] italic">
          A comprehensive program designed for working professionals, integrating theoretical concepts with practical applications through laboratory components and applied projects that simulate real-world nuclear industry challenges.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="group p-6 rounded-lg bg-[#1f2335] border border-[#29293f] transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#7aa2f7]/30 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-[#7aa2f7]/5 hover:scale-[1.02]">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between mb-2">
        <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#7aa2f7]">Naval Nuclear Power Training Command</h4>
        <div class="text-[#bb9af7]">2003-2004</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-[#7dcfff] mb-1">Nuclear Power School</div>
      <div class="flex items-center text-[#9ece6a] mb-4">
        <span class="mr-2">📍</span>
        Charleston, SC
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4">
        <h5 class="text-[#bb9af7] mb-2">Phase 1: Nuclear Power School (6 months)</h5>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[#a9b1d6]">
          <% [
            "Advanced calculus, differential equations, and applied mathematics",
            "Classical and nuclear physics with emphasis on reactor theory",
            "Physical chemistry, radiochemistry, and materials science",
            "Electrical engineering theory and power distribution systems",
            "Thermodynamics, heat transfer, and fluid dynamics",
            "Reactor theory and neutron behavior",
            "Radiation effects, protection, and detection"
          ].each do |bullet| %>
            <li class="flex items-baseline group/item">
              <span class="text-[#9ece6a] mr-2 group-hover/item:text-[#f7768e] transition-colors">⁜</span>
              <%= bullet %>
            </li>
          <% end %>
        </ul>

        <h5 class="text-[#bb9af7] mt-6 mb-2">Phase 2: Nuclear Power Training Unit (6 months)</h5>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[#a9b1d6]">
          <% [
            "Hands-on operation of naval nuclear reactor prototypes",
            "Supervised reactor control room operations under various conditions",
            "Practical application of electrical, mechanical, and reactor systems",
            "Emergency procedure training and casualty response drills",
            "Progressive qualification in various watch stations",
            "Team coordination and operational communication",
            "Documentation, logs, and reporting requirements"
          ].each do |bullet| %>
            <li class="flex items-baseline group/item">
              <span class="text-[#9ece6a] mr-2 group-hover/item:text-[#f7768e] transition-colors">⁜</span>
              <%= bullet %>
            </li>
          <% end %>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-[#24283b] rounded-lg text-[#a9b1d6] italic">
          An intensive 12-14 month program often described as "drinking from a fire hose" academically, with 8-10 hours of daily classes plus additional study time. The program transforms sailors into nuclear operators capable of safely running naval propulsion systems, emphasizing both theoretical knowledge and practical application.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section> 